WEBVTT

01:31.130 --> 01:34.970
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.060 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 3]

01:40.350 --> 01:40.870
Hurry!

01:44.350 --> 01:44.950
Father!

01:45.479 --> 01:46.120
Father!

01:52.479 --> 01:53.200
Mr. Gu,

01:53.759 --> 01:54.560
you're awake.

01:55.120 --> 01:56.680
I just removed the arrow for you.

01:56.680 --> 01:58.150
It had barbs,

01:58.350 --> 02:00.280
but luckily it didn't hit the bone.

02:01.510 --> 02:02.120
Water.

02:03.430 --> 02:03.840
Yu'er.

02:03.920 --> 02:04.350
Okay.

02:05.430 --> 02:07.310
My father said you can't drink water.

02:07.310 --> 02:07.680
Here,

02:08.080 --> 02:10.880
take in some moisture;
it'll make you feel better.

02:22.000 --> 02:23.280
Why am I here?

02:25.030 --> 02:25.520
Yu'er,

02:26.870 --> 02:28.329
go outside and keep watch.

02:36.840 --> 02:37.540
Mr. Gu,

02:38.030 --> 02:39.610
you took such a big risk

02:40.400 --> 02:42.400
to help me get through this trouble.

02:43.240 --> 02:44.560
Please accept my bow.

02:45.590 --> 02:46.440
We were

02:46.680 --> 02:49.030
originally waiting for you
at the entrance of Shuangjia Mountain,

02:49.030 --> 02:49.760
but Yu'er

02:49.840 --> 02:52.000
insisted on meeting you
at the foot of the mountain.

02:52.000 --> 02:53.630
Thankfully we listened to her,

02:53.630 --> 02:55.630
otherwise we would have missed you.

02:55.630 --> 02:57.510
You're incredibly lucky.

02:57.710 --> 02:58.770
In this heavy snow,

02:59.079 --> 03:00.430
you turned into a popsicle

03:00.430 --> 03:01.590
in just half an hour.

03:02.910 --> 03:03.580
Mr. Chang,

03:05.400 --> 03:06.800
I know you mean well,

03:07.920 --> 03:10.120
but have you thought about the fact that

03:10.400 --> 03:12.200
if they catch up and find out,

03:12.630 --> 03:13.760
it won't just be you—

03:14.190 --> 03:15.940
all your men below

03:16.590 --> 03:18.190
will be dragged down because of me too.

03:18.190 --> 03:20.960
I, Chang Si, have spent my whole life
roaming the world.

03:20.960 --> 03:22.680
Not to mention someone who's saved me,

03:22.680 --> 03:24.150
even if we just met by chance,

03:24.150 --> 03:25.810
I can't leave them on the road.

03:29.870 --> 03:30.760
Don't worry.

03:31.079 --> 03:32.780
We'll leave at dawn

03:33.000 --> 03:34.590
and travel without stopping.

03:34.590 --> 03:35.590
We should reach Songshan

03:35.590 --> 03:36.520
before dark.

03:37.000 --> 03:39.000
They won't be able to
catch up with us now.

03:39.000 --> 03:40.400
They have elite cavalry.

03:41.310 --> 03:43.110
Even if we leave a night earlier,

03:43.960 --> 03:45.120
within four hours,

03:45.590 --> 03:46.720
they could catch up.

03:49.840 --> 03:51.000
In this snow,

03:51.710 --> 03:53.040
the tracks from the cart

03:53.980 --> 03:54.910
can't be erased.

04:26.120 --> 04:27.010
Hurry, hurry!

04:35.310 --> 04:35.870
Don't move!

04:35.870 --> 04:36.510
Mr. Chang,

04:38.480 --> 04:39.580
I have a way

04:41.240 --> 04:42.640
that we can escape alive.

04:51.750 --> 04:52.830
Those behind, keep up!

04:52.830 --> 04:53.600
Hurry up!

05:16.040 --> 05:17.240
Those in front, stop!

05:18.240 --> 05:19.160
Stop!

05:21.270 --> 05:22.920
-Stop!
-Stop!

05:23.000 --> 05:24.000
Stop right there!

05:24.270 --> 05:25.510
Stop! Stop!

05:25.560 --> 05:26.360
Stop!

05:27.190 --> 05:27.920
Follow them!

05:28.680 --> 05:29.310
Dismount!

05:30.560 --> 05:31.720
Stop! Stop!

05:32.110 --> 05:33.040
Surround them!

05:35.390 --> 05:36.190
Commander Xu.

05:37.270 --> 05:38.070
Commander Xu.

05:38.120 --> 05:39.360
What's wrong?

05:47.140 --> 05:47.940
Commander Xu.

05:48.630 --> 05:49.630
Get out of the way!

05:53.600 --> 05:54.430
Move aside!

05:55.870 --> 05:56.400
Make way!

06:11.950 --> 06:13.350
There's nothing in here.

06:13.680 --> 06:14.750
Nothing here either.

06:14.750 --> 06:16.680
I don't have anything here either.

06:16.870 --> 06:17.480
Old man,

06:19.360 --> 06:20.420
what's on the cart?

06:21.510 --> 06:22.310
It's big fish.

06:24.560 --> 06:25.560
Where's the salt?

06:25.560 --> 06:26.410
There's no salt.

06:26.410 --> 06:26.830
Go down and check.

06:26.830 --> 06:27.830
That's not right.

06:28.920 --> 06:30.560
Could it be that you've colluded

06:30.560 --> 06:32.290
to help the exiles escape?

06:32.630 --> 06:34.159
In my entire life,

06:34.240 --> 06:35.360
I've never eaten anything bad

06:35.360 --> 06:36.560
or done anything illegal.

06:36.560 --> 06:39.870
People like us who navigate the world
fear getting into trouble with the authorities.

06:39.870 --> 06:41.530
Who would dare help with this?

06:43.000 --> 06:45.460
-I'm telling the truth.
-Have you found him?

06:45.950 --> 06:46.560
No!

06:46.600 --> 06:47.240
No!

06:47.750 --> 06:48.560
Impossible!

06:49.750 --> 06:51.770
How could two legs outrun four?

06:52.430 --> 06:53.120
We haven't seen anyone else

06:53.120 --> 06:54.240
along the way.

06:56.159 --> 06:57.360
He must be in the cart.

06:58.070 --> 06:58.770
Sir.

08:03.950 --> 08:04.720
Do you know

08:04.750 --> 08:06.950
the consequences of harboring exiles?

08:07.170 --> 08:09.000
How many lives do I have

08:09.120 --> 08:10.390
that I'd dare do such a thing?

08:10.390 --> 08:11.920
I'm telling you the truth.

08:17.830 --> 08:18.430
Sir,

08:19.120 --> 08:19.720
we were supposed to

08:19.720 --> 08:20.720
go to Jilin today.

08:21.040 --> 08:22.390
How about we wait until you return

08:22.390 --> 08:23.920
and then search carefully?

08:36.000 --> 08:37.130
Everyone, mount up!

08:43.720 --> 08:44.600
Old man,

08:45.440 --> 08:46.720
if we don't find this person,

08:46.720 --> 08:48.250
I'll hold you responsible.

08:48.840 --> 08:50.270
Don't think you can escape.

08:50.270 --> 08:51.800
I'm telling the truth, sir.

09:09.420 --> 09:10.330
Heizi,

09:10.870 --> 09:12.670
hurry up and get on the cart.

09:14.500 --> 09:15.900
Don't cause any trouble!

09:17.480 --> 09:17.960
Heizi,

09:18.960 --> 09:20.820
go to the top of the mountain ahead

09:21.120 --> 09:22.070
and keep watch.

09:22.790 --> 09:24.250
If those people come back,

09:24.270 --> 09:25.670
send a signal immediately.

09:25.670 --> 09:26.600
Be careful.

09:26.630 --> 09:28.320
We can't afford to take any risks.

09:28.320 --> 09:28.940
Got it.

09:43.840 --> 09:44.480
Mr. Chang,

09:45.150 --> 09:46.350
to be on the safe side,

09:46.670 --> 09:48.670
let the cart
that is filled with salt go first.

09:48.670 --> 09:49.630
Brothers,

09:49.670 --> 09:50.870
take out

09:50.910 --> 09:51.610
the cooking tools,

09:51.610 --> 09:52.790
break the ice,

09:53.030 --> 09:54.960
and pour the ice pieces
into those three carts.

09:54.960 --> 09:56.480
Take your flatbreads,

09:56.550 --> 09:57.550
soak them in sesame oil,

09:57.550 --> 09:59.030
tear them up, and put them in the baskets.

09:59.030 --> 10:01.120
Tie the ropes
and put the baskets in the water.

10:01.120 --> 10:03.320
After half an hour, pull the baskets up.

10:03.320 --> 10:04.240
Catch the fish

10:04.320 --> 10:05.850
and load them into the cart.

10:06.670 --> 10:08.530
The terrain here is flat and open.

10:08.840 --> 10:10.370
You can't hide anyone here.

10:10.590 --> 10:12.520
We have no choice but to take a risk.

10:47.360 --> 10:48.090
How did it go?

10:50.030 --> 10:51.030
Did you fool them?

10:53.360 --> 10:54.520
Did you send out

10:55.790 --> 10:56.910
what I asked you to send?

10:56.910 --> 10:57.630
Don't worry.

10:57.630 --> 10:58.890
It's all taken care of.

10:59.440 --> 10:59.970
Let's go.

11:00.720 --> 11:01.360
The salt license

11:01.360 --> 11:03.080
has already been stamped
with the city's official seal.

11:03.080 --> 11:04.240
There's another thing

11:04.240 --> 11:06.040
I need your help with, Mr. Chang.

11:09.990 --> 11:11.670
There's a bundle of ledgers outside.

11:11.670 --> 11:12.630
Send someone immediately to deliver it

11:12.630 --> 11:14.030
to the Military Governor
of Jilin's residence.

11:14.030 --> 11:15.190
It's the life-saving letter.

11:15.190 --> 11:16.520
The sooner, the better.

11:16.880 --> 11:17.810
[There's a bundle of ledgers outside.
Send someone immediately to deliver it]

11:17.830 --> 11:18.800
[to the Military Governor
of Jilin's residence.
The sooner the better.]

11:18.830 --> 11:22.290
[Shuangjia Mountain]

11:24.080 --> 11:27.100
[For: The Military Governor of Jilin]

11:27.190 --> 11:30.310
[Ningguta]

11:31.610 --> 11:34.340
[Ningguta]

11:40.360 --> 11:42.230
[Military Governor
of Jilin]

11:46.270 --> 11:47.360
Move faster!

11:48.240 --> 11:49.960
-Put the box down gently.
-Sir.

11:49.960 --> 11:50.720
Sir.

11:51.630 --> 11:52.840
What's wrong?

11:52.840 --> 11:53.360
Speak!

12:00.030 --> 12:01.690
Subordinate greets you, sir.

12:05.150 --> 12:06.600
I have committed a capital offense

12:06.600 --> 12:08.770
for failing to meet you outside the city.

12:08.770 --> 12:10.650
[The Military Governor of Jilin]

12:12.120 --> 12:13.550
I have delayed for a day.

12:14.320 --> 12:15.080
I had planned to head to Shengjing

12:15.080 --> 12:16.140
to pay my respects.

12:21.270 --> 12:22.030
What is this?

12:22.480 --> 12:24.280
These are high-grade fox pelts.

12:24.320 --> 12:25.510
These are tiger skins

12:25.510 --> 12:27.150
which were personally handpicked by me.

12:27.150 --> 12:28.670
Each one was shot clean through the eyes
with a single arrow,

12:28.670 --> 12:30.930
leaving not a single scratch on the hide.

12:33.390 --> 12:34.160
What is this?

12:34.440 --> 12:35.360
This is ginseng wine.

12:35.360 --> 12:36.790
It's all wild mountain ginseng.

12:36.790 --> 12:38.390
I picked the best ones to soak

12:38.480 --> 12:40.010
and made it for your health.

12:46.270 --> 12:46.840
Any more?

12:48.860 --> 12:50.060
There's more inside.

12:51.000 --> 12:52.240
Quite a good haul.

12:53.960 --> 12:54.840
Give it to him.

12:57.080 --> 12:57.600
[Account of General's Mansion]

12:57.910 --> 12:58.430
Look.

12:58.460 --> 13:00.600
Are these accounts correct?

12:59.020 --> 13:01.770
[Accounts of General's Mansion]
[Made by Gu Pingyuan]

13:02.910 --> 13:03.710
What's wrong?

13:04.080 --> 13:06.810
Don't you even recognize
your own stuff anymore?

13:07.600 --> 13:08.350
Sir,

13:08.960 --> 13:09.750
those accusations

13:09.750 --> 13:10.440
were made by the prisoners.

13:10.440 --> 13:11.870
It's all fabricated nonsense.

13:11.870 --> 13:13.910
I am completely loyal to you, General.

13:13.910 --> 13:14.750
The man who delivered the ledger

13:14.750 --> 13:16.010
also attached a note.

13:16.630 --> 13:19.120
It says you're corrupt
and are abusing your power.

13:19.120 --> 13:20.750
You've treated imperial prisoners

13:20.750 --> 13:22.000
like your personal slaves,

13:22.000 --> 13:25.260
taking what you want
and showing no regard for their lives.

13:26.320 --> 13:26.960
If

13:27.480 --> 13:28.610
I don't take action,

13:29.270 --> 13:31.560
he'll report it to the capital.

13:32.240 --> 13:33.080
Gu Pingyuan

13:33.120 --> 13:34.190
is one of your men.

13:34.450 --> 13:36.350
So I need you, my friend,

13:36.750 --> 13:37.810
to take off your hat

13:38.760 --> 13:40.080
and let me conduct a proper investigation.

13:40.080 --> 13:40.860
Sir,

13:41.080 --> 13:42.720
I swear this is absolutely false.

13:42.720 --> 13:44.320
I am an officer
appointed by the imperial court.

13:44.320 --> 13:46.450
You can't believe the words of exiles.

13:49.510 --> 13:50.960
The note also accuses

13:51.670 --> 13:54.330
you of supplying horses
to the southern rebels.

13:54.550 --> 13:55.080
That's

13:55.440 --> 13:57.740
a crime punishable
by the extermination of one's entire clan—

13:57.740 --> 13:59.830
even I could be implicated.

14:02.270 --> 14:03.240
Is there

14:03.720 --> 14:04.390
any truth to this?

14:04.390 --> 14:05.050
None at all.

14:12.010 --> 14:14.510
By order of
the Military Governor of Jilin,

14:14.840 --> 14:17.670
Xu San, fourth-rank
battalion commander of Ningguta,

14:17.670 --> 14:19.240
is found to be greedy by nature,

14:19.240 --> 14:20.760
colluding with rebels

14:20.870 --> 14:22.510
and grossly derelict in duty,

14:22.510 --> 14:23.040
is hereby

14:23.230 --> 14:24.430
stripped of his rank,

14:24.630 --> 14:25.960
sentenced to 50 lashes,

14:26.320 --> 14:29.080
and sent to the military horse camp
for penal labor.

14:29.080 --> 14:32.140
Xu San, fourth-rank
battalion commander of Ningguta,

14:32.270 --> 14:33.960
is found to be greedy by nature,

14:33.960 --> 14:35.580
colluding with rebels

14:37.770 --> 14:45.690
[Songshan Inn]

15:15.000 --> 15:19.400
[Capital Examination Hall,
Xianfeng 5,1855]

15:19.550 --> 15:28.250
[To the Court]

15:26.220 --> 15:26.840
My friend,

15:27.160 --> 15:29.420
how do I get to Room 17
in the Xuan section?

15:29.870 --> 15:31.340
Don't wander around,

15:31.550 --> 15:33.670
or you'll get into trouble
if the patrol sees you.

15:33.670 --> 15:35.270
I came from Anhui
to find a fellow townsman.

15:35.270 --> 15:36.120
When I left,

15:36.150 --> 15:36.750
his mother was barely

15:36.750 --> 15:37.810
holding on to life.

15:37.960 --> 15:39.000
She asked me that when I found him,

15:39.000 --> 15:40.270
I should make sure to call him back.

15:40.270 --> 15:41.200
This person's surname is Gu,

15:41.200 --> 15:42.750
and his given name is Pingyuan.

15:42.750 --> 15:43.950
The patrol is coming!

15:53.760 --> 15:54.780
[To the Court]

15:56.440 --> 15:57.960
I came from Anhui
to find a fellow townsman.

15:57.960 --> 15:58.790
When I left,

15:58.840 --> 15:59.440
his mother was barely

15:59.440 --> 16:00.500
holding on to life.

16:00.580 --> 16:01.720
She asked me, when I find him,

16:01.720 --> 16:02.870
to make sure I call him back.

16:02.870 --> 16:03.790
This person's surname is Gu,

16:03.790 --> 16:05.520
and his given name is Pingyuan.

16:06.200 --> 16:07.120
I am Gu Pingyuan.

16:07.120 --> 16:08.850
Who was looking for me just now?

16:09.910 --> 16:10.870
I am Gu Pingyuan.

16:11.320 --> 16:12.320
I'm from Anhui.

16:12.390 --> 16:12.720
Stop!

16:12.720 --> 16:14.450
Who was looking for me just now?

16:15.240 --> 16:16.470
I am Gu Pingyuan.

16:16.720 --> 16:17.640
I'm from Anhui.

16:17.670 --> 16:18.790
No talking in the examination hall!

16:18.790 --> 16:20.030
Was someone looking for me earlier?

16:20.030 --> 16:20.440
Go!

16:22.400 --> 16:23.580
I am Gu Pingyuan.

16:23.870 --> 16:25.910
The examination hall
is filled with scholars.

16:25.910 --> 16:27.320
Could it be that you're arresting thieves?

16:27.320 --> 16:28.630
My elderly mother is gravely ill at home.

16:28.630 --> 16:29.870
My heart is torn with grief.

16:29.870 --> 16:31.240
I need to turn in my exam paper.

16:31.240 --> 16:32.970
I won't take this exam anymore.

16:35.360 --> 16:36.160
Investigate!

16:36.250 --> 16:38.510
For creating a disturbance
at the examination hall

16:38.510 --> 16:39.960
and vilifying his superiors,

16:39.960 --> 16:41.510
scholar Gu Pingyuan of Huizhou

16:41.510 --> 16:43.000
is sentenced to 50 blows

16:44.270 --> 16:46.080
and 15 years of exile in Ningguta

16:46.720 --> 16:49.370
for gross insubordination.

16:58.870 --> 16:59.670
-Go!
-Go!

17:34.590 --> 17:35.960
You fool.

17:36.070 --> 17:37.640
Someone has set you up.

17:37.750 --> 17:39.380
But I heard it clearly.

17:39.960 --> 17:40.480
His mother is so sick

17:40.480 --> 17:42.140
that she's barely hanging on.

17:42.830 --> 17:44.470
He's so young

17:44.510 --> 17:45.960
and is exiled for 15 years.

17:45.960 --> 17:47.110
What a shame.

17:47.110 --> 17:48.030
Who would want to harm him?

17:48.030 --> 17:48.880
How old is he?

17:48.880 --> 17:50.310
He's getting caught up in this mess.

17:50.310 --> 17:51.400
Exactly.

18:05.070 --> 18:06.130
Why are you crying?

18:12.030 --> 18:12.830
I don't cry.

18:15.270 --> 18:17.130
You can still wipe your tears now.

18:18.310 --> 18:20.020
You scared us all.

18:20.400 --> 18:21.550
You've been talking nonsense,

18:21.550 --> 18:22.350
shouting to fight one moment

18:22.350 --> 18:23.480
and to kill the next.

18:23.480 --> 18:24.240
If someone didn't know better,

18:24.240 --> 18:26.500
they'd think you were a mountain bandit.

18:30.270 --> 18:31.030
I'm thirsty.

18:32.310 --> 18:33.040
I'm thirsty.

18:57.290 --> 18:58.350
What are you doing?

18:58.960 --> 19:00.100
No, no, no.

19:00.200 --> 19:01.400
Be good now.

19:02.270 --> 19:03.640
You've got a fever,

19:03.790 --> 19:05.720
plus that injury, is making it worse.

19:05.720 --> 19:06.640
The cold water has drawn out

19:06.640 --> 19:07.970
all the heat and toxins.

19:08.160 --> 19:08.790
Father and I

19:08.790 --> 19:10.830
have been taking turns looking after you.

19:10.830 --> 19:11.710
The doctor said

19:11.830 --> 19:14.690
these next few days
are critical for your recovery.

19:20.680 --> 19:22.610
Let's not talk about this anymore.

19:22.750 --> 19:23.310
I...

19:24.110 --> 19:25.310
Let me tell you a joke.

19:29.510 --> 19:30.680
There was a man

19:30.830 --> 19:33.270
who did many good deeds in his life.

19:33.550 --> 19:34.850
After he died,

19:34.960 --> 19:36.000
he met the King of Hell.

19:36.000 --> 19:37.410
The King of Hell told him,

19:37.510 --> 19:38.400
"You can

19:38.440 --> 19:40.510
choose whichever family
you want to be reborn into;

19:40.510 --> 19:41.960
just pick whichever you like."

19:41.960 --> 19:42.920
So he said,

19:43.680 --> 19:46.440
"I want to be reborn into
a family that's filthy rich,

19:46.440 --> 19:47.610
no parents,

19:47.640 --> 19:49.160
a sweet wife, pretty concubines,

19:49.160 --> 19:50.400
a lifetime of peace and good fortune,

19:50.400 --> 19:51.000
and a long,

19:51.270 --> 19:52.530
happy life at the end."

19:53.400 --> 19:54.860
The King of Hell then said,

19:55.440 --> 19:56.070
"Buddy,

19:56.400 --> 19:57.590
if a place like that existed,

19:57.590 --> 19:58.410
I'd go myself

19:58.440 --> 20:01.500
and let you take over as King of Hell.
How's that sound?"

20:10.000 --> 20:11.200
Not funny, is it?

20:27.680 --> 20:28.880
If I get another life,

20:32.310 --> 20:33.590
I want to be like you—

20:35.640 --> 20:37.240
ride with a band of horsemen,

20:38.920 --> 20:40.180
skip all the studying.

20:47.480 --> 20:49.740
Why are you suddenly talking about this?

20:50.750 --> 20:51.550
You won't die.

20:57.070 --> 20:57.670
Is that so?

21:04.920 --> 21:05.580
Look at you,

21:07.400 --> 21:09.460
always calling yourself a tough guy,

21:09.640 --> 21:11.840
and now you're scared to death of dying.

21:13.640 --> 21:14.720
I've spent my life

21:14.750 --> 21:15.880
traveling around with my father.

21:15.880 --> 21:17.310
I've slept on cliff edges,

21:17.310 --> 21:18.350
run into wolf packs on the plains,

21:18.350 --> 21:19.610
but I was never scared.

21:24.480 --> 21:25.920
Well… Maybe just a little at first,

21:25.920 --> 21:27.780
but then I wasn't afraid anymore.

21:29.590 --> 21:31.310
If I really die,

21:33.550 --> 21:35.680
at least I've got you guys to cry for me,

21:36.590 --> 21:37.920
to bury me.

21:39.960 --> 21:40.830
I'm not afraid.

21:42.310 --> 21:43.170
I'm not afraid.

22:16.550 --> 22:18.410
Let Gu Pingyuan die for all I care.

22:18.660 --> 22:21.110
Haven't we gotten into
enough trouble already?

22:21.110 --> 22:22.590
Keeping an exile with us

22:22.720 --> 22:25.380
is grounds for being confiscated
and beheaded.

22:25.440 --> 22:27.040
How could you be so reckless?

22:29.480 --> 22:30.480
If it were up to me,

22:30.960 --> 22:32.430
when we get to Shanhai Pass,

22:32.430 --> 22:33.110
we should find a village,

22:33.110 --> 22:33.910
find a family,

22:33.920 --> 22:34.720
give them some money

22:34.720 --> 22:35.680
and let them take care of him.

22:35.680 --> 22:36.790
Whether he survives or not

22:36.790 --> 22:38.190
is no longer our concern.

22:39.350 --> 22:40.350
Right now,

22:40.960 --> 22:42.160
he's seriously sick.

22:42.240 --> 22:43.260
If we leave him,

22:43.880 --> 22:44.960
he'll be doomed.

22:48.480 --> 22:50.440
Then why must we take him with us?

22:55.790 --> 22:58.040
Why are you so angry?

23:02.030 --> 23:02.710
Heizi,

23:04.880 --> 23:05.810
I'm getting old.

23:06.790 --> 23:07.810
In the future,

23:08.720 --> 23:09.900
gather the brothers

23:10.310 --> 23:11.790
continue running the horse caravan.

23:11.790 --> 23:12.920
Remember one thing:

23:14.640 --> 23:16.510
No matter how vast the sky and earth,

23:16.510 --> 23:18.970
nothing is more important
than a human life.

23:19.310 --> 23:21.400
Heaven has the virtue of preserving life,

23:21.400 --> 23:23.550
so even if you encounter a stranger
who needs help,

23:23.550 --> 23:24.960
you should still help.

23:25.550 --> 23:26.350
Moreover,

23:26.880 --> 23:28.120
he has done us a favor.

23:31.590 --> 23:32.590
If you're scared,

23:33.790 --> 23:34.920
you can leave first.

23:47.130 --> 23:51.340
[Capital]

23:47.550 --> 23:50.200
It's dry today.

23:51.030 --> 23:52.350
The Young Master is back!

23:52.350 --> 23:53.760
The Young Master is back!

23:54.110 --> 23:54.960
Hurry up; go to the main room

23:54.960 --> 23:55.790
and report to the Master!

23:55.790 --> 23:56.320
Let's go!

23:56.400 --> 23:58.060
There will surely be a reward.

24:01.200 --> 24:02.000
Young Master.

24:02.240 --> 24:03.040
Young Master.

24:04.960 --> 24:06.690
-Young Master!
-Young Master!

24:07.030 --> 24:07.550
Young Master!

24:07.550 --> 24:08.350
Young Master.

24:08.400 --> 24:09.730
Last month, the butler came back

24:09.730 --> 24:10.510
and said that

24:10.640 --> 24:11.480
you had made a big deal

24:11.480 --> 24:12.720
by yourself.

24:12.490 --> 24:15.980
[Li Mansion]

24:13.440 --> 24:14.750
Seeing you so full of confidence,

24:14.750 --> 24:16.400
I guess the deal was done.

24:16.720 --> 24:18.240
Young Master, the Master requests
your presence.

24:18.240 --> 24:19.110
Go directly to the study to meet him.

24:19.110 --> 24:19.880
It looks so good!

24:19.880 --> 24:20.680
Young Master Li Qin,

24:20.680 --> 24:22.740
the Master is waiting for you inside.

24:29.070 --> 24:30.090
I have returned, Father.

24:30.090 --> 24:31.890
I pay my respects to you, Father.

24:32.960 --> 24:33.700
Come in.

24:44.200 --> 24:44.680
Father.

24:45.510 --> 24:46.440
I have returned.

24:46.640 --> 24:48.440
I pay my respects to you, Father.

24:49.240 --> 24:50.570
Is everything settled?

24:51.400 --> 24:52.160
Yes.

24:52.640 --> 24:54.750
Once the horse reaches Liaoyang,
someone will take over.

24:54.750 --> 24:56.070
Ms. Su is returning south.

24:56.070 --> 24:56.750
I rushed back overnight

24:56.750 --> 24:57.860
this time.

24:57.960 --> 24:59.020
I know all about it.

24:59.950 --> 25:02.050
Ms. Su sent a letter through someone.

25:02.590 --> 25:04.520
The journey has been smooth so far.

25:05.460 --> 25:06.660
Ms. Su wrote a letter?

25:07.690 --> 25:09.090
What did she say about me?

25:09.160 --> 25:10.490
What do you want to know?

25:12.970 --> 25:14.170
This time, I probably

25:14.880 --> 25:16.340
didn't do anything wrong.

25:17.770 --> 25:19.700
It seems you did everything right.

25:22.200 --> 25:22.660
Father,

25:23.110 --> 25:23.910
what's wrong?

25:28.910 --> 25:32.190
[Merchant of the Capital, Li Wantang]

25:29.400 --> 25:30.960
Why are you dealing with

25:31.000 --> 25:31.930
runaway exiles?

25:32.590 --> 25:33.270
Do you know

25:33.310 --> 25:35.310
the Qing Dynasty's law regarding exiles?

25:35.310 --> 25:38.770
Harboring or concealing an exile
is a crime equal to their own.

25:39.000 --> 25:40.920
Our family is prosperous and powerful.

25:40.920 --> 25:42.270
Many people are watching us,

25:42.270 --> 25:44.030
just waiting for us to get into trouble

25:44.030 --> 25:45.830
so they can attack us all at once.

25:47.310 --> 25:47.880
Father,

25:47.920 --> 25:49.580
it's not as serious as you say.

25:50.160 --> 25:50.880
Zhang Guangfa

25:50.880 --> 25:51.880
bought a ginseng doll

25:51.880 --> 25:53.540
and even brought back a child.

25:53.750 --> 25:54.790
I placed the mother and child,

25:54.790 --> 25:55.720
who were entrusted by my brother,

25:55.720 --> 25:56.920
in our pharmacy,

25:57.750 --> 25:58.880
changed their names,

25:58.880 --> 26:00.720
and let them work as apprentices
while supporting them.

26:00.720 --> 26:02.320
I wasn't talking about them.

26:02.350 --> 26:03.550
You mean Gu Pingyuan?

26:04.270 --> 26:04.920
Without that fellow,

26:04.920 --> 26:06.160
we wouldn't have made it back at all.

26:06.160 --> 26:06.620
Father,

26:06.960 --> 26:08.560
you haven't met that person,

26:08.750 --> 26:10.340
but I think he's

26:10.550 --> 26:11.200
a righteous

26:11.200 --> 26:12.400
and responsible man.

26:12.790 --> 26:13.830
I just don't know

26:13.880 --> 26:14.680
whether he made it out alive this time.

26:14.680 --> 26:15.680
If he did survive,

26:16.270 --> 26:18.070
I would like to be friends with him.

26:18.070 --> 26:19.330
You want to be friends?

26:19.920 --> 26:21.980
Why do you want to be friends with him?

26:22.200 --> 26:24.060
He brought two people out at once.

26:24.680 --> 26:26.440
If the authorities investigate us,

26:26.440 --> 26:28.440
our whole family
could be ruined because of you!

26:28.440 --> 26:29.270
But Ms. Su...

26:29.310 --> 26:30.640
Ms. Su does her thing,

26:30.680 --> 26:32.280
and you should mind your own.

26:33.590 --> 26:34.790
If she wants to rebel,

26:35.030 --> 26:36.760
do you want to get involved too?

26:36.920 --> 26:38.160
She went to buy warhorses,

26:38.160 --> 26:39.690
and I told you to assist her.

26:39.920 --> 26:41.400
Whether she can bring them in or not

26:41.400 --> 26:42.350
is none of your concern.

26:42.350 --> 26:44.240
Why are you acting like
you're so important,

26:44.240 --> 26:45.840
even getting others to help?

26:46.350 --> 26:46.950
Father,

26:47.270 --> 26:48.920
whatever I do is wrong anyway.

26:48.920 --> 26:50.680
You're the wisest man under the heavens.

26:50.680 --> 26:52.480
But it wasn't my idea to go there.

26:52.550 --> 26:53.460
It was you who told me

26:53.460 --> 26:54.480
to wait for Ms. Su.

26:54.790 --> 26:56.030
If Ms. Su is a rebel,

26:56.050 --> 26:56.780
what are you?

26:57.400 --> 26:58.860
And now you're blaming me?

27:06.440 --> 27:07.900
What do you think of Ms. Su?

27:12.510 --> 27:13.370
She's a beauty,

27:15.480 --> 27:16.440
sure—

27:17.880 --> 27:19.030
but a cold, venomous one,

27:19.030 --> 27:19.760
like a snake.

27:21.070 --> 27:22.480
And her methods

27:23.130 --> 27:25.190
are ruthless enough to scare people.

27:25.880 --> 27:28.280
I've traveled through half of the country.

27:29.070 --> 27:31.200
I've met all kinds of businesspeople.

27:31.960 --> 27:33.160
She should be considered

27:33.160 --> 27:34.760
the smartest one of them all.

27:35.370 --> 27:36.770
I dare not refuse to help,

27:37.350 --> 27:38.880
nor do I dare to provoke her.

27:40.270 --> 27:42.370
She is the calamity in my fate.

27:43.750 --> 27:44.240
Father,

27:45.550 --> 27:47.080
how did you come to know her?

27:47.340 --> 27:48.000
Why are you

27:48.000 --> 27:49.460
trying so hard to help her?

27:50.270 --> 27:53.330
She is doing nothing
more than enticing me with profit.

27:53.480 --> 27:55.020
Businessmen crave money,

27:55.200 --> 27:56.400
scholars crave fame,

27:56.550 --> 27:58.070
and officials crave power.

27:58.070 --> 27:59.930
As long as someone wants something,

27:59.930 --> 28:01.590
it's like jumping off a cliff.

30:01.750 --> 30:03.750
Heaven really lent a hand this time.

30:03.750 --> 30:04.690
The heat toxins

30:04.750 --> 30:06.180
have all been reduced.

30:13.270 --> 30:13.720
Come.

30:21.350 --> 30:23.150
I've become as fragile as paper,

30:23.830 --> 30:25.680
and even drinking a mouthful of porridge
takes effort.

30:25.680 --> 30:27.070
You're just recovering from
a major injury.

30:27.070 --> 30:28.730
You'll gradually get better.

30:29.070 --> 30:30.550
To survive a great disaster

30:30.550 --> 30:32.080
is to be blessed afterward.

30:33.720 --> 30:34.370
Mr. Chang,

30:35.090 --> 30:36.510
My life

30:37.400 --> 30:38.590
was saved by you.

30:39.790 --> 30:42.190
I'll never forget that
for as long as I live.

30:42.270 --> 30:43.700
I don't know if I'll ever get the chance

30:43.700 --> 30:44.540
to repay you.

30:44.790 --> 30:46.540
Don't talk about repayment.

30:46.830 --> 30:48.880
I have spent my whole life
navigating the world.

30:48.880 --> 30:50.180
This is the last time

30:50.440 --> 30:51.640
I'll get to save you.

30:52.110 --> 30:53.710
It's a perfect ending for me.

30:54.310 --> 30:55.370
Where is Ms. Chang?

30:56.110 --> 30:58.310
These past few days, I've been in a daze.

30:59.160 --> 31:00.740
But every time I woke up,

31:01.480 --> 31:03.160
she was either brewing medicine

31:03.160 --> 31:05.420
or fetching water, wringing out cloths.

31:06.590 --> 31:08.320
For this worthless life of mine

31:08.790 --> 31:10.990
to receive such blessings is a miracle.

31:11.440 --> 31:13.040
I want to thank her properly.

31:14.400 --> 31:15.550
Let's not talk about her.

31:15.550 --> 31:16.720
Let's talk about you.

31:16.720 --> 31:18.650
What are your plans for the future?

31:20.550 --> 31:21.310
I don't know.

31:22.640 --> 31:23.680
Everyone in my hometown

31:23.680 --> 31:25.520
knows I was stripped of my title

31:26.400 --> 31:27.420
and exiled.

31:28.920 --> 31:30.970
I'm afraid if I suddenly show up,

31:32.070 --> 31:33.830
I'll draw the attention
of the authorities.

31:33.830 --> 31:35.090
You should come with me

31:35.110 --> 31:36.040
back to Pingyao.

31:36.270 --> 31:37.190
I'm afraid it's not appropriate.

31:37.190 --> 31:37.720
Fine,

31:38.030 --> 31:39.030
just listen to me.

31:40.310 --> 31:42.080
Who else is in your family?

31:42.510 --> 31:43.840
I have an elderly mother

31:44.440 --> 31:45.700
and a younger brother.

31:45.960 --> 31:47.690
There's also Teacher, Mr. Bai.

31:48.070 --> 31:49.150
Mr. Bai?

31:49.750 --> 31:51.210
Mr. Bai was very kind to me.

31:52.310 --> 31:53.680
He even promised his own daughter

31:53.680 --> 31:54.680
to me in marriage.

32:04.880 --> 32:05.350
Mr. Gu,

32:05.880 --> 32:06.940
didn't you say

32:07.110 --> 32:08.490
you weren't married?

32:10.590 --> 32:12.120
Indeed.

32:12.920 --> 32:14.230
We had agreed to

32:14.310 --> 32:17.400
wait until after the imperial exam
before discussing marriage.

32:17.400 --> 32:18.350
I don't know

32:18.550 --> 32:19.810
what they're up to now.

32:30.750 --> 32:32.080
You should rest well

32:32.430 --> 32:33.240
and talk less.

32:33.440 --> 32:34.840
It's bad for your health.

32:47.110 --> 32:48.240
Where are you going?

32:48.960 --> 32:49.960
To deliver medicine.

32:49.960 --> 32:50.820
Sit down there.

32:52.720 --> 32:54.320
I have something to tell you.

33:02.550 --> 33:03.150
Yu'er,

33:04.640 --> 33:05.550
from now on,

33:06.110 --> 33:07.520
you don't need to

33:07.960 --> 33:09.490
take care of Mr. Gu anymore.

33:13.830 --> 33:14.360
Alright.

33:15.960 --> 33:17.620
I'll go wash the medicine pot.

33:17.790 --> 33:19.590
We don't need to find a doctor anymore.

33:19.590 --> 33:20.590
We can just throw him out on the street

33:20.590 --> 33:21.480
and we'll even save on rent.

33:21.480 --> 33:22.810
Stop talking nonsense!

33:22.880 --> 33:23.410
Sit down!

33:30.400 --> 33:32.640
Aren't you the one
who wants him to survive?

33:32.640 --> 33:34.770
You risked your life to bring him here.

33:35.030 --> 33:36.650
What I mean is,

33:38.550 --> 33:39.640
your body may be there,

33:39.640 --> 33:40.840
but your heart isn't.

33:41.640 --> 33:42.300
These days,

33:42.320 --> 33:44.750
you've been looking after him
day and night.

33:44.750 --> 33:46.000
I've seen it all.

33:47.000 --> 33:48.060
I'm reminding you,

33:48.430 --> 33:49.960
you're still a young lady,

33:50.790 --> 33:52.990
and haven't found a marriage match yet.

33:53.480 --> 33:54.520
I'm old now,

33:55.160 --> 33:57.240
and I can't navigate the world anymore.

33:57.240 --> 33:58.040
In the future,

33:58.350 --> 34:00.580
you need to marry properly.

34:01.110 --> 34:02.250
I don't have a son;

34:02.400 --> 34:04.170
I can only live with you.

34:04.720 --> 34:05.560
You can't

34:06.200 --> 34:07.870
marry an exiled criminal.

34:07.920 --> 34:08.500
Father,

34:09.510 --> 34:10.350
I saved him

34:10.400 --> 34:12.030
not because I want to marry him,

34:12.030 --> 34:13.719
but because Mr. Gu is a good man

34:13.800 --> 34:15.130
and has helped us.

34:15.510 --> 34:16.360
I can't just

34:16.400 --> 34:17.830
watch him die like this.

34:18.760 --> 34:20.480
Let alone he's an exiled criminal,

34:20.480 --> 34:22.409
even if he were a demon or a monster,

34:23.480 --> 34:24.880
I'd still save him today.

34:31.110 --> 34:31.820
It's hot.

34:38.889 --> 34:43.290
[Yanmen Pass of Shanxi]

34:42.570 --> 34:43.770
We're almost home!

34:43.920 --> 34:45.300
Everyone, cheer up!

34:49.150 --> 34:49.900
Look.

34:50.110 --> 34:51.420
That's Yanmen Pass.

34:51.800 --> 34:53.600
The storyteller used to mention

34:53.920 --> 34:55.070
Lord Yang with his golden blade,

34:55.070 --> 34:56.070
leading 7 wolves and 8 tigers

34:56.070 --> 34:56.960
to defend here.

34:57.590 --> 34:58.760
If it weren't for
that treacherous official Pan Renmei

34:58.760 --> 35:00.550
deceiving the Double Dragon Society,

35:00.550 --> 35:01.400
how could a

35:01.440 --> 35:02.510
hero of such caliber

35:02.510 --> 35:04.550
have been driven to
his death on this mountain?

35:04.550 --> 35:05.610
I really regret it.

35:06.440 --> 35:07.690
He died;

35:07.760 --> 35:09.090
why are you regretting?

35:09.630 --> 35:10.760
I've been following my father around,

35:10.760 --> 35:12.000
always traveling here and there.

35:12.000 --> 35:13.260
I used to complain that

35:13.400 --> 35:16.030
when we listened to stories,
we would only hear half of them.

35:16.030 --> 35:17.480
No matter how much we cared,

35:17.480 --> 35:18.540
we'd always leave.

35:18.630 --> 35:19.480
When we came back,

35:19.480 --> 35:21.190
either the storyteller had changed

35:21.190 --> 35:23.390
or they were telling a different story.

35:23.630 --> 35:24.880
Only that year, when the heavy rain

35:24.880 --> 35:26.190
and the horse gang couldn't move on

35:26.190 --> 35:27.400
was I able to listen to the entire story

35:27.400 --> 35:28.880
of "Legend of the Yang Family."

35:28.880 --> 35:30.020
Unfortunately,

35:30.630 --> 35:32.430
all the characters I liked died.

35:33.110 --> 35:34.670
But now, looking back,

35:35.070 --> 35:36.600
those were rare good times.

35:37.230 --> 35:37.840
Look,

35:38.320 --> 35:39.440
these past few days,

35:39.440 --> 35:40.900
my father's been so happy,

35:41.110 --> 35:43.970
and you've been here
with me, talking and laughing.

35:44.320 --> 35:45.720
I wonder,

35:46.150 --> 35:48.030
when I look back on these days
in the future,

35:48.030 --> 35:49.560
will I feel especially sad?

35:55.230 --> 35:56.400
You probably think I'm just rambling.

35:56.400 --> 35:58.230
My father always says I'm a daydreamer

35:58.230 --> 35:59.290
and never serious.

35:59.840 --> 36:02.170
I think what you're saying is quite right.

36:02.520 --> 36:03.710
The ancients often said,

36:03.710 --> 36:05.110
"Cherish the spring blossoms

36:05.110 --> 36:07.370
and never forget the joy in happy times."

36:07.400 --> 36:08.960
There aren't many

36:09.280 --> 36:11.210
moments of true happiness in life.

36:11.280 --> 36:13.110
The next time your father
goes with the horse gang,

36:13.110 --> 36:14.230
I want to follow him,

36:14.230 --> 36:15.630
and learn a bit about business.

36:15.630 --> 36:16.690
My father said that

36:16.760 --> 36:17.760
you're a scholar,

36:18.320 --> 36:20.590
meant to take the imperial exams
and become an official.

36:20.590 --> 36:22.050
Business is a lowly trade.

36:22.440 --> 36:23.880
Me, becoming a top scholar?

36:23.880 --> 36:25.800
I've already been stripped of my title.

36:25.800 --> 36:26.440
I'll never have the qualifications

36:26.440 --> 36:28.240
to be a scholar in this lifetime.

36:28.960 --> 36:30.880
In this world, there are scholars,
farmers, artisans, and merchants.

36:30.880 --> 36:31.840
But who says a merchant

36:31.840 --> 36:33.300
is any less than a scholar?

36:34.280 --> 36:35.510
Do you think that if I beg your father

36:35.510 --> 36:36.590
to take me as his student

36:36.590 --> 36:37.760
and teach me about business,

36:37.760 --> 36:38.620
he would agree?

36:39.030 --> 36:41.000
My father would surely be delighted.

36:41.000 --> 36:42.070
If he won't teach you,

36:42.070 --> 36:42.780
I can!

36:47.030 --> 36:47.700
Brother Gu.

36:49.590 --> 36:50.960
Let me ask you something.

36:50.960 --> 36:51.490
Go ahead.

36:53.230 --> 36:55.020
You escaped and traveled so far

36:55.130 --> 36:55.730
just to

36:55.760 --> 36:57.490
learn business from my father?

36:58.280 --> 36:59.400
If I said yes,

36:59.630 --> 37:00.890
I would be lying to you.

37:01.710 --> 37:02.740
The truth is

37:06.510 --> 37:08.590
that all these hardships I've been through

37:08.590 --> 37:09.640
are too strange.

37:10.320 --> 37:12.720
I still can't figure out
why they happened.

37:12.880 --> 37:14.080
But in this lifetime,

37:14.150 --> 37:15.610
even if it costs me my life,

37:15.670 --> 37:17.070
I must find out the truth.

37:18.670 --> 37:19.190
What?

37:20.110 --> 37:21.120
When I was a child,

37:21.280 --> 37:22.880
my father left
for the imperial examination

37:22.880 --> 37:24.010
and never returned.

37:24.710 --> 37:25.760
When it was my turn to go to the capital

37:25.760 --> 37:26.840
for the examination,

37:26.840 --> 37:28.190
my mother repeatedly urged me

37:28.190 --> 37:29.110
to do whatever it takes

37:29.110 --> 37:31.240
to find out what happened to my father.

37:31.280 --> 37:32.150
I went to the capital

37:32.150 --> 37:33.710
and searched everywhere without success.

37:33.710 --> 37:34.370
After that,

37:34.920 --> 37:37.520
something went wrong
in the examination hall.

37:37.670 --> 37:40.030
I always feel
there's a hand behind all this,

37:40.030 --> 37:41.110
an invisible hand

37:41.880 --> 37:44.480
striking deadly blows
at both my father and me.

37:44.870 --> 37:46.190
As for the rights and wrongs

37:46.190 --> 37:47.520
of what truly happened,

37:47.570 --> 37:48.480
if I hadn't escaped

37:48.480 --> 37:49.570
and remained in Ningguta,

37:49.570 --> 37:52.000
I could have racked my brains
forever to no avail.

37:52.000 --> 37:54.130
Then where will you uncover the truth?

37:54.800 --> 37:55.510
At first, I only thought of

37:55.510 --> 37:58.070
escaping first
and worrying about the rest later.

37:58.070 --> 37:59.400
But now, truly an exile,

37:59.760 --> 38:01.650
I find the world vast
yet there's nowhere to run.

38:01.650 --> 38:03.370
I'm truly caught between a rock

38:03.370 --> 38:04.300
and a hard place.

38:05.190 --> 38:05.840
Gu,

38:07.190 --> 38:08.190
you're a good man.

38:08.840 --> 38:11.230
There are paths everywhere
for people to travel.

38:11.230 --> 38:12.800
Perhaps you should settle here for now.

38:12.800 --> 38:13.960
and learn some business?

38:13.960 --> 38:15.400
Wait until the imperial court
grants amnesty,

38:15.400 --> 38:16.740
then it won't be too late to move on.

38:16.740 --> 38:18.270
Why sigh and lament so much?

38:19.320 --> 38:20.120
You're right.

38:20.550 --> 38:22.150
My scholarly bitterness

38:22.230 --> 38:23.230
is showing again.

38:23.510 --> 38:25.310
Prepare to go down the mountain!

38:26.400 --> 38:27.460
We're almost home.

38:28.940 --> 38:33.500
[Yingxun Pavilion]

38:33.950 --> 38:37.460
[Pingyao, Shanxi]

38:37.530 --> 38:40.010
[Yingxun Pavilion]

38:45.510 --> 38:46.900
Long time no see, Mr. Chang.

38:46.900 --> 38:48.230
Where have you been making your fortune?

38:48.230 --> 38:49.830
Making money, making money.

38:50.690 --> 38:51.840
Heizi, you're back!

38:52.830 --> 38:53.880
Hello, Mr. Chang!

38:54.510 --> 38:55.490
Hello.

38:57.800 --> 38:59.280
Happy early New Year, Mr. Chang.

38:59.280 --> 39:01.080
Wish you prosperity, Mr. Chang.

39:02.630 --> 39:03.960
May you prosper, Mr. Chang.

39:03.960 --> 39:05.150
Wishing you prosperity!

39:05.150 --> 39:07.550
Mr. Chang, wish you wealth and prosperity.

39:09.630 --> 39:10.960
Mr. Chang, you're back!

39:12.130 --> 39:12.800
Mr. Chang,

39:12.880 --> 39:14.810
it's been a while since we last met.

39:18.390 --> 39:19.270
[Bandit's Bane]

39:21.880 --> 39:23.680
Haven't you seen silver before?

39:25.190 --> 39:27.240
My goodness,
look at that mountain of silver!

39:27.240 --> 39:28.750
It must weigh thousands of catties.

39:28.450 --> 39:31.050
[Proprietor of Taiyufeng, Wang Tiangui]

39:29.000 --> 39:30.670
No wonder it's called Bandit's Bane.

39:30.670 --> 39:32.470
Who on earth could move all that?

39:33.280 --> 39:35.500
This is Wang Tiangui's draft bank.

39:35.590 --> 39:36.320
The most heartless bastard

39:36.320 --> 39:37.840
in all of Pingyao.

39:38.150 --> 39:39.140
If it weren't for him,

39:39.140 --> 39:40.070
my father wouldn't have ended up

39:40.070 --> 39:41.630
exiled to that freezing wasteland.

39:41.630 --> 39:42.160
Let's go.

39:43.660 --> 39:44.440
What happened to Mr. Chang?

39:44.440 --> 39:45.370
What's going on?

39:46.070 --> 39:46.760
Two years ago, my father

39:46.760 --> 39:48.920
had already decided to
stop traveling around.

39:48.920 --> 39:50.210
He bought a house

39:50.320 --> 39:52.000
and leased two acres
of government salt fields.

39:52.000 --> 39:52.630
Wang Tiangui

39:52.630 --> 39:53.950
heard it form someone

39:54.150 --> 39:54.670
that

39:54.840 --> 39:56.040
our house

39:56.070 --> 39:58.070
was built on the dragon's head
of Pingyao County,

39:58.070 --> 39:59.190
the most prosperous location.

39:59.190 --> 40:00.030
He tried to buy it several times,

40:00.030 --> 40:01.320
but my father refused to sell.

40:01.320 --> 40:02.550
So he instigated that scoundrel Li

40:02.550 --> 40:03.730
to file a complaint
at the government office.

40:03.730 --> 40:04.360
The county magistrate

40:04.360 --> 40:05.620
was also bribed by him.

40:05.670 --> 40:06.880
The case was shelved
without ever being heard,

40:06.880 --> 40:08.140
and they sealed off our salt fields.

40:08.140 --> 40:10.030
They said we couldn't sell any salt
until the case was settled.

40:10.030 --> 40:12.030
It nearly ruined our entire family.

40:20.960 --> 40:21.880
Butler,

40:27.550 --> 40:29.290
Mr. Chang has returned?

40:29.630 --> 40:31.930
Four salt carts returned first yesterday.

40:30.260 --> 40:33.400
[Butler of Prince Pingyao's Mansion]

40:32.070 --> 40:33.540
He just went over there.

40:34.070 --> 40:36.740
I saw a

40:37.070 --> 40:38.250
young man

40:38.320 --> 40:39.710
among the horse gang,

40:41.800 --> 40:44.150
who looked unfamiliar.

40:45.360 --> 40:46.830
Go check it out.

40:49.590 --> 40:50.570
Mr. Gu!

40:51.630 --> 40:53.830
Take a look at my courtyard house.

40:53.920 --> 40:55.410
It's the best quadrangle

40:55.920 --> 40:57.110
in all of Pingyao.

40:57.630 --> 40:58.420
Great feng shui,

40:58.420 --> 40:59.620
gathers good energy.

41:00.360 --> 41:01.560
Show off your skills.

41:03.670 --> 41:04.550
This is the reception hall.

41:04.550 --> 41:04.880
Go.

41:05.000 --> 41:06.800
Let me take you inside for a look.

41:08.900 --> 41:09.670
Mr. Gu.

41:10.070 --> 41:11.600
This is the back courtyard.

41:16.790 --> 41:17.530
Mr. Chang.

41:18.030 --> 41:19.080
Please try

41:19.160 --> 41:20.970
this freshly opened aged wine.

41:24.150 --> 41:24.760
Good wine.

41:25.670 --> 41:26.580
Come, smell it.

41:28.070 --> 41:30.030
In our Shanxi tradition,
when a daughter is born,

41:30.030 --> 41:31.920
we bury fifty pounds of wine.

41:32.070 --> 41:33.480
We dig it up and drink it
on her wedding day—

41:33.480 --> 41:35.270
it's called "Daughter's Red."

41:35.630 --> 41:37.430
For a son, it's "Scholar's Red."

41:38.280 --> 41:39.490
These jars here

41:39.670 --> 41:41.960
are the finest goods,

41:42.000 --> 41:43.800
brewed from the top distillery in Pingyao.

41:43.800 --> 41:45.130
Let's enjoy it tonight.

41:45.590 --> 41:47.070
I want to see you all under the table
by the end of it!

41:47.070 --> 41:47.940
Yes, Mr. Chang.

41:48.000 --> 41:48.630
Thank you, Mr. Chang.

41:48.030 --> 41:49.590
[Chang]

41:48.920 --> 41:49.670
Thank you, Mr. Chang.

41:49.670 --> 41:50.110
Come.

41:50.110 --> 41:51.120
Come, brothers.

41:53.670 --> 41:55.200
This is the back courtyard.

41:55.710 --> 41:57.200
This is the main house,

41:57.230 --> 41:58.560
the master's position,

41:58.760 --> 41:59.800
where the male owner lives.

41:59.800 --> 42:01.070
This is the west wing,

42:01.710 --> 42:02.770
where Yu'er lives.

42:03.480 --> 42:04.400
And this east side

42:04.400 --> 42:05.460
is the raised area,

42:05.480 --> 42:07.810
a place for drinking tea and socializing.

42:09.030 --> 42:09.510
Heizi.

42:11.920 --> 42:12.880
Did you pay for the salt?

42:12.880 --> 42:13.610
Don't worry,

42:13.670 --> 42:15.280
I've settled all payments
and brought back the money.

42:15.280 --> 42:16.800
Quickly prepare the red envelopes.

42:16.800 --> 42:17.630
Early tomorrow morning,

42:17.630 --> 42:19.890
everyone will be going home for New Year.

42:19.930 --> 42:21.030
Add one more measure.

42:21.030 --> 42:21.840
Everyone

42:21.960 --> 42:23.360
gets an extra 10 percent.

42:25.150 --> 42:26.090
But I'm afraid

42:26.400 --> 42:26.840
it's still not enough

42:26.840 --> 42:28.840
to repay Wang Tiangui's bank money.

42:29.710 --> 42:31.710
Where there are people, there is money.

42:31.710 --> 42:33.440
Everyone has followed us
through ice and snow,

42:33.440 --> 42:34.900
living in fear for so long.

42:35.280 --> 42:38.090
It doesn't matter
if we get less ourselves.

42:38.360 --> 42:38.890
Alright.

42:39.850 --> 42:40.760
Don't stop me!

42:41.840 --> 42:42.870
Is old Chang here?

42:42.960 --> 42:43.890
I'm telling you,

42:43.960 --> 42:45.110
tell him to come out right now

42:45.110 --> 42:46.400
and return my salt field!

42:46.400 --> 42:47.330
What's going on?

42:48.000 --> 42:48.600
Mr. Chang,

42:48.710 --> 42:49.480
it's Li Laizi and...

42:49.480 --> 42:51.030
Wang Tiangui's bank butler.

42:51.030 --> 42:52.760
I'll drive them away right now.

42:53.230 --> 42:54.510
New Year is coming soon.

42:54.510 --> 42:56.770
How can we drive people away at this time?

42:57.880 --> 42:58.510
Be polite

42:58.710 --> 42:59.670
and invite them in.

42:59.670 --> 43:00.070
Alright.
